From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 12:56:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] configs: imx8mp_00377: set explicit CONFIG_SYS_MALLOC_F_LEN

The board's own defconfig never set CONFIG_SYS_MALLOC_F_LEN, so it fell
back to the Kconfig default (0x10000) instead of the larger 0x18000
NXP's own imx8mp_evk_defconfig uses. This value governs U-Boot proper's
own pre-relocation early-malloc pool -- used for tasks like
unflattening the devicetree before full malloc is available. This
board's devicetree carries considerably more content than the
reference EVK's (cargt board-specific peripherals across Ethernet,
USB-C, camera, HDMI, etc.), so the smaller default pool is a plausible
cause of a silent hang in board_init_f() before the console is ever
initialized -- symptoms observed on real hardware: SPL and BL31 both
complete cleanly (DDR trained, EEPROM read back correctly), but U-Boot
proper's own banner never prints at all.

CONFIG_SPL_SYS_MALLOC_F_LEN is pinned explicitly alongside it at its
prior value (0x10000): Kconfig's default for the SPL variant falls
back to CONFIG_SYS_MALLOC_F_LEN when not set explicitly, so bumping
the non-SPL value alone silently bumped SPL's own pool too, on the
first attempt at this fix -- shifting SPL's memory layout enough to
turn a previously-clean DDR training pass into a hang partway through.
Pin both explicitly so each pool is sized independently and on
purpose, not by an implicit Kconfig cascade.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Cargt board specific]
---
 configs/imx8mp-cargt-00377-00365_defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configs/imx8mp-cargt-00377-00365_defconfig b/configs/imx8mp-cargt-00377-00365_defconfig
index 0000000..0000001 100644
--- a/configs/imx8mp-cargt-00377-00365_defconfig
+++ b/configs/imx8mp-cargt-00377-00365_defconfig
@@ -2,6 +2,8 @@
 CONFIG_ARCH_IMX8M=y
 CONFIG_TEXT_BASE=0x40200000
 CONFIG_SYS_MALLOC_LEN=0x2000000
+CONFIG_SYS_MALLOC_F_LEN=0x18000
+CONFIG_SPL_SYS_MALLOC_F_LEN=0x10000
 CONFIG_SPL_GPIO=y
 CONFIG_SPL_LIBCOMMON_SUPPORT=y
 CONFIG_SPL_LIBGENERIC_SUPPORT=y
--
2.34.1
